  "details": "I unable to move when the station in avatar disappears because of avatar change while we open the main menu.\n\nWith VR mode, we cannot move with stick, and unable to move and change perspective with Desktop mode.\n\nWith VR mode, we can open and click the quick menu so we can re-join to fix the issue but with Desktop mode, Quick menu will be shown not front of the screen so we may not be able to click the quick menu and unable to fix this issue without re-launching the VRChat.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n\n1. Player A wears an avatar with a station.\n\n2. Player B rides the station in Player A's avatar.\n\n3. Player B opens the main menu (or some other UI that disables movement like Chatbox).\n\n4. Player A changes their avatar.\n\n5. Player B will be forced to leave the station, and now they are unable to move.",
